"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 6000$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$k$$$ ($$$0 \\le n, k \\le 10^6$$$) — the initial position of point $$$A$$$ and desirable absolute difference."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the minimum number of steps to make point $$$B$$$ exist."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6\n4 0\n5 8\n0 1000000\n0 0\n1 0\n1000000 1000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n0\n3\n1000000\n0\n1\n0\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case (picture above), if we set the coordinate of $$$B$$$ as $$$2$$$ then the absolute difference will be equal to $$$|(2 - 0) - (4 - 2)| = 0$$$ and we don't have to move $$$A$$$. So the answer is $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, we can increase the coordinate of $$$A$$$ by $$$3$$$ and set the coordinate of $$$B$$$ as $$$0$$$ or $$$8$$$. The absolute difference will be equal to $$$|8 - 0| = 8$$$, so the answer is $$$3$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/1d65044e73d8528d62d57a3ba21cdb788063f9c9bb8f6bcd208a9c451393e9c1.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1401A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1401/problem/A"}